## 📍 PHASE 7: Error Handling & Edge Cases (~0.5 days)

**Status:** Not started - Depends on all phases

### Edge Cases
- [ ] Empty cart display
- [ ] Very large cart (100+ items)
- [ ] Very long product names
- [ ] Invalid prices/formats
- [ ] Missing product data
- [ ] Duplicate items in cart
- [ ] Session timeout
- [ ] Double-click add to cart

### Error Scenarios
- [ ] API returns 404 (not found)
- [ ] API returns 500 (server error)
- [ ] Network timeout
- [ ] No internet connection
- [ ] CORS error
- [ ] Invalid JSON response
- [ ] Missing required fields

### User Messaging
- [ ] Error messages are user-friendly
- [ ] Error messages suggest actions
- [ ] Success messages are clear
- [ ] Loading states are obvious
- [ ] Empty states are helpful

### Logging & Monitoring
- [ ] Error logging implemented
- [ ] Debug mode for development
- [ ] Performance metrics tracked
- [ ] API call tracking

